we do not send the subtitle on the polling:

{noformat}// It's difficult to prepare subtitle from polling, because
// it's required additional data in the cache, so mobile app will
// respect subtitle only from getActiveOrder or createRide responses.{noformat}

{quote}We should make active_order_ui fields optional from polling and use fallback with the data previously received from {{/getActiveOrder}} . This allows us to keep the same structure and at the same time do not send all the data in {{/polling}}. Ex. there is no need (and complicated) to send subtitle on each polling call because it doesn’t dynamically change. The same applies to the title icon we are displaying for the premium users.{quote}

